@startuml http_dual_authentication
title CampusClaw HTTP Dual Authentication

' Source evidence:
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/mode/server/ServerMode.java: buildRoutes lines 237-274, wireServerRoutes lines 285-307, applyCorsHeaders lines 340-344
