actor Caller
rectangle "One user input" as Input

package "Selected: Session Events and Entry History" as CandidateA {
  rectangle "POST /sessions/{id}/events\nuser.message + direct SSE" as SendEvent
  rectangle "Internal active execution\nno public run_id" as Execution
  rectangle "Transient message previews" as Preview
  rectangle "Persisted MessageEntry\nentry_id + entry_seq" as Entry
  rectangle "Session History recovery" as History
}

package "Superseded: caller-visible Run" as CandidateB {
  rectangle "POST /sessions/{id}/runs" as CreateRun
  rectangle "Run\nrun_id + frozen snapshot" as Run
  rectangle "GetRun / Run Events" as RunObserve
  rectangle "Abort / Steer by run_id" as RunControl
  rectangle "Per-Run recovery and audit" as RunAudit
}

Caller --> Input
Input --> SendEvent : selected contract
SendEvent --> Execution : start one internal execution
Execution --> Preview : stream live progress
Execution --> Entry : persist authoritative facts
Entry --> History : recover after disconnect

Input ..> CreateRun : superseded design
CreateRun --> Run
Run --> RunObserve
Run --> RunControl
Run --> RunAudit

note bottom of CandidateA
Confirmed later on 2026-08-17.
No public run_id or Run-scoped API.
Direct POST SSE is a CampusClaw transport choice.
end note

note bottom of CandidateB
The 1.15.0 public Run decision is superseded.
It remains in version history only.
